THANH PHAN BEN THU BA DI KEM BAN DONG GOI
=========================================

FFmpeg (ffmpeg.exe, ffprobe.exe trong thu muc _internal\ffmpeg)
    Ban dung o day la ban "essentials" cua Gyan Doshi, phat hanh theo giay phep
    GNU General Public License version 3 (GPL v3).
    Ma nguon va giay phep day du: https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/
                                   https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html
    FFmpeg duoc goi nhu mot chuong trinh rieng qua dong lenh, khong lien ket
    vao ma nguon cua AutoSub Studio.

Mo hinh nhan dang giong noi (thu muc _internal\models\faster-whisper-small)
    Chuyen doi tu Whisper cua OpenAI, phat hanh theo giay phep MIT.
    Nguon: https://huggingface.co/Systran/faster-whisper-small

Mo hinh doc chu tren hinh (di kem thu vien rapidocr-onnxruntime)
    Dua tren PaddleOCR, phat hanh theo giay phep Apache License 2.0.

Cac thu vien Python khac (PySide6, SQLAlchemy, faster-whisper, piper,
deep-translator, onnxruntime...) giu giay phep rieng cua chung; ban sao giay
phep nam trong thu muc _internal.
